 ?[annotation_transport]: "Is the cleanest incremental path a per-file delta request, a server push notification, or client-side trust in existing watched-file updates with less rebuild logic?"
 ?[visibility_rule]: "Which surfaces are allowed to keep warming data while hidden, and which must go fully cold unless visible?"
}

